    <content>
      <![CDATA[<div class="math-env env-definition" id="env-definition-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">定义</span><span class="env-num">1</span><span class="env-title">上定向集，下定向集</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>环 $R$ 的一个理想 $\mathfrak{a}$ 是 $R$ 的加法子群，且对任意 $r \in R$、$a \in \mathfrak{a}$，有 $ra \in \mathfrak{a}$。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-axiom" id="env-axiom-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">公理</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>选择公理（Zorn 引理形式）。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-theorem" id="thm1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">定理</span><span class="env-num">1</span><span class="env-title">第一同构定理</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>如果 $\varphi: G \to H$ 是群同态，则 $G &#x2F; \ker \varphi \cong \operatorname{Im} \varphi$。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-theorem" id="thm2"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">定理</span><span class="env-num">2</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>如果 $R$ 是主理想整环，则 $R$ 的每个理想都是主理想。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-remark" id="env-remark-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">注记</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>由 <a class="env-ref" href="#thm1">定理 1</a> 可得：$\ker \varphi$ 的陪集与 $\operatorname{Im} \varphi$ 的元素一一对应。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-lemma" id="env-lemma-1.2"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">引理</span><span class="env-num">1.2</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>手动编号示例。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-proposition" id="env-proposition-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">命题</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>每个主理想整环都是诺特环。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-corollary" id="env-corollary-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">推论</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>有限生成模的分解性质。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-hypothesis" id="env-hypothesis-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">假设</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>$A$ 是诺特环，$\mathfrak{a}$ 是其理想。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-alarm" id="env-alarm-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">警示</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>此结论仅在交换环情形成立，非交换情形不适用。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-proof"><span class="env-name">证明</span><div class="env-body"><p>设 $\mathfrak{a}$ 是 $R$ 的理想，取 $a \in \mathfrak{a}$……</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-remark" id="env-remark-2"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">注记</span><span class="env-num">2</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>这个结论可以推广到更一般的情形。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-example" id="env-example-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">例</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>$\mathbb{Z}$ 是主理想整环。</p></div></div><div class="math-env env-exercise" id="env-exercise-1"><div class="env-head"><span class="env-name">练习</span><span class="env-num">1</span></div><div class="env-body"><p>证明 $\mathbb{Z}[x]$ 不是主理想整环。</p></div></div>]]>
    </content>
